    "The other 21 exact query/path/region/severity/semantic-flow identities match the retained prior review. All their primary and supporting business source bytes remain unchanged except the reviewed package lock and installer.",
    "Security gate schema 2 binds exact sources and artifacts/traces, rejects still-vulnerable vendor-minor entries, and does not use the wall clock. Legacy schema 1 retains its original deadline. The real-Git future-date test and new-CVE/version/ELF/flow counterexamples pass; existing scan failure, missing proof and legacy approval checks remain in the 83 passing tool tests."
  ],
